{"title":"Peak Leaf Peep Weekend: Riding Two Northern New Mexico Classics – John Watson","link":"https://theradavist.com/peak-leaf-peep-weekend-riding-two-northern-new-mexico-classics","date":1791786410000,"content":"<p><em>Our team is taking today off, but we wanted to share some vignettes from peak leaf-peep weekend in Northern New Mexico. John’s got a fun gallery full of some of the area’s best trails with a stunning display of fall foliage…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/c28d14d8ada47cb93bff9c73adbd87e5ccc44f312d75374d02c14adcbd69fbfa.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/820a9cf19b96c7000750aa347842fa0f8daf5bd19ee6b6507188d810118d3412.jpg 640w, /media/c28d14d8ada47cb93bff9c73adbd87e5ccc44f312d75374d02c14adcbd69fbfa.jpg 1800w, /media/22e5836e8999597a685e7ee4d63fca9002577500a429a3346a7a10f48b59b3e5.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Autumn is my favorite season. Especially living somewhere with actual seasons. Each year, I bring my camera on just about every ride this time of year, hoping to capture what it truly feels like to be enveloped in a gilded curtain of light. Signaling a seasonal change and a time to prepare for the long winter ahead, these few weeks feel like magic.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/07a0c702667618ebe58a364ef6c94456f3d163dbb9337ee47638affc9d4189d2.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/3b3e892d866650a5ff863f6c6431838b410b654872df3fd7d561582ec18f45fb.jpg 800w, /media/07a0c702667618ebe58a364ef6c94456f3d163dbb9337ee47638affc9d4189d2.jpg 1600w, /media/075b0ec8085e486939ae73093e9b51ed4d7adaba30680430f9f11b8df562615e.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/32d0661f05b4dbe03b3a09b1c9758569ddc74275b5114a1e5cd5e59bc1fbd612.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/b22d9dedb6761160d83895472d821a01160a6665a9d73ebab73b0b14408969e0.jpg 800w, /media/32d0661f05b4dbe03b3a09b1c9758569ddc74275b5114a1e5cd5e59bc1fbd612.jpg 1600w, /media/495c5a3d10f37bc8706298a6378ac9209b60664fc0f14ffb344e6c739c76ce49.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/ab74cd98e5aadf7c08c2f02014772be0b9b24b6309fa69e609d8f01207646edb.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/87655480c6fe60f11935d4563b453960173a24189a3f62739d8c1faadc24513b.jpg 800w, /media/ab74cd98e5aadf7c08c2f02014772be0b9b24b6309fa69e609d8f01207646edb.jpg 1600w, /media/c570c219cb208910c2e62ad545129785600fb4822cd69b1ae406cc0a2710b78e.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>We received around 10″ of rain in September, and our trails are hammered right now with lots of downed trees, so along with my camera, I’m packing my big <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/hunkenr-folding-saw-review\" target=\"_blank\">Hunkenr saw</a>, too. Last week, I came across a downed tree on a favorite trail, around a blind corner. So on Friday, I rallied the homies to roll out and do <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/santa-fe-alamos-vista-trail\" target=\"_blank\">a favorite Autumn ride</a>, peep some leaves, and take care of some deadfall. A normal 2.5-hour ride became a 4-hour, casual ride, full of photo stops, snacks, and saw time.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/9eed9f1f607bf184688dc2ba8e9ed93ca617d25b92d273d3b7d5fbefc371bc56.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/338faa14109eef012b659d85d315674f39cc1273ab0f31a8179b5bd7a93b9a5e.jpg 800w, /media/9eed9f1f607bf184688dc2ba8e9ed93ca617d25b92d273d3b7d5fbefc371bc56.jpg 1600w, /media/90284d04c5241ab6b4008aa52a4898adb6802667695096e201f397b22fa44f97.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/573f2421a74c577ad786a1570a5af97075f8fbd017b5b7c1109c393f82e3fc46.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/f7249fe85e0b9744c6e7acb3423c62156401666c89cb147442f8a5adf60eb03b.jpg 800w, /media/573f2421a74c577ad786a1570a5af97075f8fbd017b5b7c1109c393f82e3fc46.jpg 1600w, /media/0c70b1f1e10571e2edd6e42611a4ee08f9732d4f236f1c7340eac42602a21271.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f0a8ee668c879f412c70d6d1fd903038ad35d20d024f41cacb1e742cf1cd992c.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/022849f97733341db24737e921f40983413e8340a8887b12c6c70d3bec3fa96e.jpg 800w, /media/f0a8ee668c879f412c70d6d1fd903038ad35d20d024f41cacb1e742cf1cd992c.jpg 1600w, /media/9bc4456e5040406a072bbc71a9c837d858c6eaf48045378b73a83fbb374ed41f.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Then, yesterday, to celebrate a busy summer <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/designing-and-building-a-bike-shop\" target=\"_blank\">at the new Broken Spoke</a>, Kyle hired <a href=\"https://shuttletaos.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Shuttle Taos</a> to drop some of the team and some close friends off for the <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/new-mexicos-true-high-country-gems-south-boundary-trail-and-heaven-on-earth\" target=\"_blank\">South Boundary ride</a>. Hitting this ride at peak leaf change is magic, as aspen trees paint streaks of golden light as you plummet from the ride’s highest point. With rain the night prior, the roots were slick, but the dirt was tacky.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b5e05b7c1db0fe07b628d4d30aac5a1a0280ae55f80853aca1ddee66e1be6b99.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/1b9f30b3a9a6534c626d338cd0608b3c04b375653afe5d05749379d497b9102f.jpg 800w, /media/4412e495c886595a48efa6674595120a2c2d7141fc1b9673c9ba2185a9698ccf.jpg 1600w, /media/b5e05b7c1db0fe07b628d4d30aac5a1a0280ae55f80853aca1ddee66e1be6b99.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/3e9f7107365302d2e870d9acd57b54f4ef4ea589ef86ff14c120ef7c4cefec8a.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/23d2a1ca5b65b4890d58f2f7537c44efd0b0ed341d8fc888976a7fcff013957a.jpg 800w, /media/cc595272d476325dd5dcb0209601947d5ffc6effba620d655c807e0b9a376419.jpg 1600w, /media/3e9f7107365302d2e870d9acd57b54f4ef4ea589ef86ff14c120ef7c4cefec8a.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>After a full weekend of riding with friends, my cup feels full, and I hope y’all have all gotten to pedal with the homies this weekend. We’ll be back tomorrow with a really fun one, too!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/bf41eec4a60ac971851afa68950e9ddcbd518d09204e64b1fe72bdcdad9f5641.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/4879ca674b0f9f2a5abd2ce8686cebb96482a0d52ecc01a97295fed877711476.jpg 640w, /media/bf41eec4a60ac971851afa68950e9ddcbd518d09204e64b1fe72bdcdad9f5641.jpg 1800w, /media/10b7dc31340c6e0f7da83b289b3ffdfab2462493bf128779232ae5ca6715cfc6.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Enjoy some photos from Peak Leaf Peep Weekend in the gallery, including a few from Kyle Klain!</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/peak-leaf-peep-weekend-riding-two-northern-new-mexico-classics\">Peak Leaf Peep Weekend: Riding Two Northern New Mexico Classics</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/peak-leaf-peep-weekend-riding-two-northern-new-mexico-classics#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"24c1704bed0742dcb5fc040b6a7129b18c15d42a2a2d7f320de4ff0f9357b266","category":"Cycling"}